  "worked_solution": "We can write the function $f$ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(A) & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{a}_{11} & {a}_{12} & {a}_{13} \\\\ {a}_{21} & {a}_{22} & {a}_{23} \\\\ {a}_{31} & {a}_{32} & {a}_{33} \\\\ {a}_{41} & {a}_{42} & {a}_{43}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{a}_{11}+2{a}_{21}-{a}_{31}+3{a}_{41}\\,\\, & {a}_{12}+2{a}_{22}-{a}_{32}+3{a}_{42}\\,\\, & {a}_{13}+2{a}_{23}-{a}_{33}+3{a}_{43}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂{f}_{2}}{∂{a}_{32}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{a}_{32}}({a}_{12}+2{a}_{22}-{a}_{32}+3{a}_{42})=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
